        {
          "id": "8c04d4c1-0d26-4e3f-a093-4ec6e7fd82c7",
          "listId": "3a6f3ff3-61ba-4074-8fa4-4616eef309c8",
          "title": "Project Key Domain sanitization",
          "description": "When someone adds a domain to the project key, we need to sanitize it and normalize it before storing it in the db. this is important for CORS and also for security reasons.\n\nexample.com\nwww.example.com\nhttps://example.com\n\nNormalize before storing:\nlowercase\nremove protocol\nremove trailing slash\nAnd compare only hostnames in code/api/Api/Application/ProjectKeys/ProjectKeyMiddleware.cs\n\n",
          "labels": [
            {
              "id": "2633c7da-7d04-4a38-8239-148cb27a04d3",
              "title": "Easy",
